SUMMARY:Accepting the Miracles in Our Lives
DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group\n**"You do what you
  can to make your life right. And when you have done 100 percent of everyt
 hing you can do\, Divine Spirit steps in with the miracle."**\n—Harold K
 lemp\, The Language of Soul\, p. 108\n\nThere are times when we find ourse
 lves in impossible situations and wonder how to resolve them\, only to hav
 e a seemingly small series of coincidences miraculously make the impossibl
 e possible. When you know it can't be just a coincidence\, it's often some
 thing more.\n\nPlease join us for an open discussion to share your thought
 s\, insights\, questions\, and stories. We will explore:\n\n**What is a mi
 racle?**\n\n* How do we recognize the miracles in our lives?\n* What are t
 he spiritual principles behind experiencing miracles?\n\nWe look forward t
 o seeing you there.
