SUMMARY:Resonate With the God Current Within You—ECK Light and Sound Ser
 vice
DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group\n“The inner spiri
 tual force\, the ECK\, is the God Force. It tries to direct us into better
  avenues of living\, if we will allow It to. It will also show Itself thro
 ugh the humblest of Its creatures—if only we will be the humblest of Its
  creatures.”\n—Harold Klemp\,\n*ECKopedia: The ECKANKAR Lexicon*\, p. 
 62\n\n**Would you like to have the experience of resonating with the God C
 urrent within you?**\n\nThe God Force is within each of us as Soul\, our t
 rue identity\, and is ready to guide us if we open our hearts and consciou
 sness to Its constant presence.\nWe can do this by singing the ancient man
 tra\, HU\, which allows us to tune into this inner spiritual force.\n\nHea
 r others share how they have been directed to better avenues of living and
  made better spiritual choices by aligning with the ECK\, the God Current.
 \n\n**We are pleased to let you know that we will have ASL interpretation\
 , live closed captioning\, and simultaneous Spanish translation.**\n\nThis
  is a family-friendly event\, celebrating our true nature as Soul at any a
 ge.\nThis special free Zoom event is open to everyone—invite your family
  and friends!\n\nYou are welcome to join the session any time after 10:30 
 a.m. to enjoy the prelude music until the program begins. Upon joining the
  webinar\, attendees will be in view-only mode.
