SUMMARY:Want to Take Your Spiritual Life to the Next Level?
DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group\n**Do you want to l
 earn more about Eckankar\, the path of Spiritual Freedom?**\n\n**Are you l
 ooking for a step-by-step path to spiritual transformation?**\n**Do you wa
 nt to discover a deeper understanding of who you truly are**\n**as Soul\, 
 a divine spark?**\n\n**Is your family seeking ways to bring spirituality i
 nto the home**\n**that's beyond religion?**\n\nIf you are wondering how th
 is path can take your spiritual life to the next level\, join in to learn 
 more about what it means to become an ECK student.\n\nWe will discuss bene
 fits\, what is involved\, the cost\, how it might fit into your busy life\
 , and so much more!\n\nCome with your questions and curiosity as we explor
 e the ways Eckankar can open your heart to your own personal\, unique conn
 ection with the Divine.\n\nIf you are curious about the teachings of Eckan
 kar\, brand new to the teachings or have been a student of Eckankar for a 
 year or less\, this class is for you!\n\n“**The ECK Spiritual Living Cou
